nd your room. No expensive headphones or special equipment needed. Works on any Android 13 or newer.</p>\n\n<p>👉 <b><a href=\"https://github.com/luisurielpimentelperez814-design/IVANNA-OMEGA-SUPREME/releases/latest\">Download IVANNA — latest release</a></b></p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<p>© 2026 Luis Uriel Pimentel Pérez. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>",
